  "text": "The zero-effort content recycling engine every solo creator needs to install today. Solo creators publish an insightful article once and never promote it after launch day. Ignoring your archive lets high-performing evergreen content die instead of driving steady website traffic. Build a recurring Make scenario that selects evergreen articles weekly and routes AI-rewritten snippets to Metricool. This keeps your funnels full while scaling your output without extra stress.",
